## Run

```sh
make run          # go run ./cmd, listens on :8080
make test         # go test -race ./...
make lint         # golangci-lint with the layer dependency rule
```

Configuration lives in `config.yaml`; any value can be overridden with an `APP_` environment variable, see `.env.example`.

## Add a feature

```sh
gox gen feature vehicle name:string plate:string seats:int
```

This writes the entity, service, repository, handler, tests and wiring for `vehicle`, and mounts it under `/api/v1/vehicles`. `gox destroy feature vehicle` removes it again. See `AGENTS.md` for the layout, the ownership rules and the request flow.
